+### S11 — 100 formatting violations; `yarn format` has not been run
+
+**Files:** `app/layout.tsx`, `app/page.tsx`, `app/payouts/page.tsx`, `components/Header.tsx`,
+`components/ScaffoldEthAppWithProviders.tsx`, `next.config.ts`, `scaffold.config.ts`,
+`services/web3/wagmiConfig.tsx`, `utils/scaffold-eth/getMetadata.ts`, and 2 more
+
+`yarn lint` reports 100 prettier warnings, all auto-fixable. The worst offender is
+`services/web3/wagmiConfig.tsx:20` — the entire transport/fallback/RPC-override client
+factory is collapsed onto **one 700-character line**, which is the file you'll be editing
+for S1. `app/page.tsx:30–45` has JSX at column 0 inside a nested block. Several files use
+inconsistent quote styles and missing trailing commas, suggesting hand edits that skipped
+the pre-commit hook.
+
+Note that `yarn build` runs `yarn lint`, but eslint exits 0 on warnings, so this never
+blocks anything.
+
+**Fix:** run `yarn format` at the repo root and commit the result as a standalone
